            <ArticleTitle>Gastric Bypass for Morbid Obesity in a Patient with Situs Inversus Totalis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>81-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1080/00015458.2015.11681072</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The aim of this case report is to outline the challenge and the feasibility of laparoscopic gastric bypass in a patient with situs inversus totalis. Situs inversus totalis does not seem to be a contraindication for laparoscopic surgery.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
